{"id":"9181439975c1f619","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-top-closed-cover.md","title":"ZFC Top Closed Cover","display":"df-zfc-top-closed-cover — ZFC Top Closed Cover","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top-closed-cover","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top-closed-cover"],"display":"df-zfc-top-closed-cover — ZFC Top Closed Cover","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top-closed-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top-closed-cover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top-closed-cover — ZFC Top Closed Cover"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3a78929818a246ba\" href=\"?note=3a78929818a246ba\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union\">58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (topological carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (topology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (closed cover family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in C\">\\(A\\in C\\)</span> (closed-set member bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\)</span> (closed-set predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosedCover}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosedCover}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}closed\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopClosedCover}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land(\\forall A\\in C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,A))\\land\\bigcup C=X\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}closed\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopClosedCover}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land(\\forall A\\in C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,A))\\land\\bigcup C=X\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient topology and each member's closedness use their registered predicates with the correct argument order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union","status":"resolved","id":"3a78929818a246ba","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S$ (closed-set predicate; see [[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosedCover}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}closed\\text{-}cover} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopClosedCover}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land(\\forall A\\in C\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,A))\\land\\bigcup C=X","display":true}],"bytes":1214,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3513","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-top-closed-cover.md|58-df-zfc-top-close